-- Actionlists the VMaNGOS script import gave to two NPCs: each NPC now has its own action.
-- 2026_11_19_934_world_everlake_shared_actionlists.sql: written by hand, rows built from the sources named below.
--
-- The VMaNGOS script import (core sql/custom/world/2026_09_28_15_world_vanilla_smartai.sql) links quest, gossip and
-- waypoint events to timed actionlists (smart_scripts source_type 9, ids 950000xxx). Some links point at an actionlist
-- built from a different VMaNGOS script than the one the event's own comment names, so the NPC would run another NPC's
-- actions (Yeh'kinya's scroll choice ran the Trick or Treat cast; the Dire Maul guards' choices ran Jin'rokh's talisman
-- casts). Found by checking every action_type 80/87/88 link against VMaNGOS db-70e38cd: the event's script (gossip
-- option action_script_id, quest StartScript/CompleteScript, waypoint script id) against the script the actionlist came
-- from, by content. 46 links on 16 NPCs are wrong. Celebras the Redeemed (13716) was fixed in
-- 2026_11_19_933_world_everlake_gossip_choices.sql and is not repeated here. The other 1,649 links, EventAI and the
-- hand-made door and event lists included, match.
--
-- None of the 16 NPCs runs these rows today: each has a C++ script (ScriptName classic_*) and no AIName, and the SmartAI
-- loader skips rows for creatures that are not SmartAI. The C++ scripts already do the Dire Maul buffs, the escorts and
-- the quest scenes. This file makes the rows right so that switching an NPC to SmartAI later would not wake wrong actions.
-- The actionlists themselves are left alone: other NPCs use them correctly.
--
-- 1. Direct actions, where VMaNGOS's script is one command with no text:
--    - Gossip choices (VMaNGOS gossip_scripts; the NPC casts on the player, or the player casts an item spell on
--      themselves as in 933): Yeh'kinya 8579 (50408, Create Yeh'kinya's Scroll 12998), Guard Fengus 14321 (573100,
--      22817), Guard Slip'kik 14323 (573300, 22820, triggered), Captain Kromcrush 14325 (5, 23317), Guard Mol'dar
--      14326 (573500, 22818).
--    - Waypoint scripts (VMaNGOS creature_movement_scripts): Bartleby 6090 (7975001-7975009 and 609001-609009, one emote
--      each), Lava Surger 12101 (11, set run).
-- 2. Links removed, where VMaNGOS's script is a scene of several timed steps (talk, moves, summons). These rows cannot run
--    and would run another NPC's scene if they did; the C++ script does the real one. Sirra Von'Indi 268, Shakes O'Breen
--    2610, Terenthis 3693, Dashel Stonefist 4961, Henze Faulk 6172, Narm Faulk 6177, Daphne Stilwell 6182, High Overlord
--    Saurfang 14720 (quest 7784 and two waypoints), Guard Didier 16226.
--
-- Rows changed only while they are still the imported ones. Not checked in game (the rows do not load).
-- Never edit this file once it is deployed: a later fix is a new file. Running it again changes nothing.

START TRANSACTION;

-- smart_scripts: one action of their own
